<title>GERMANY: Fresenius says 9-month profit up 41 pct.</title>
<headline>Fresenius says 9-month profit up 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   86	vs 61</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     153     vs 111</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,043   vs 1,651</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    173     vs 140</p>
<p>    Group investments			  161     vs 115</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    10,947  vs 8,995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Fresenius AG, a developer and manufacturer of medical products including dialysis technology, pharmaceuticals, intensive care and diagnostics products.  </p>
<p>Fresenius Medical Care. Nine months to September 30 (in millions of U.S. dollars)</p>
<p>    Sales					2,263     vs 2,090</p>
<p>    Net profit before provs		43	  vs 40</p>
<p>    Pretax cash flow before provs	404	 vs 414</p>
<p>NOTE -  Full name of the medical dialysis company is Fresenius Medical Care. The company was formed after Fresenius acquired National Medical Care Inc. from U.S.-based W.R. Grace. The group began operations on September 1.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
